#NEXUS

[ apaldetti2018a_fig3: Sauropodomorph time tree, panel a, fully resolved. Dinosauria, Sauropodomorpha and Sauropoda are written vertically with arrows to node symbols and kept on those nodes; Lessemsauridae is a band spanning one clade. The dashed Isanosaurus line is a ghost range, read as an ordinary branch. Replacement for mcphee2018a_fig2 (seed 20261216). 11 tips, fully resolved; 4 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 5 case (census 2, seed 20261215). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=11;
    TAXLABELS
        Ornithischia
        Theropoda
        Eoraptor
        Plateosaurus
        Anchisaurus
        Lessemsaurus
        Ingentia
        Antetonitrus
        Vulcanodon
        Isanosaurus
        Eusauropoda
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE apaldetti2018a_fig3 = [&R] (Ornithischia,(Theropoda,(Eoraptor,(Plateosaurus,(Anchisaurus,(((Lessemsaurus,Ingentia),Antetonitrus)Lessemsauridae,(Vulcanodon,(Isanosaurus,Eusauropoda)))Sauropoda)))Sauropodomorpha))Dinosauria;
END;
